        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.312,
            0.885,
            0.382
          ],
          "content": "Fold the strip into two equal parts and then open up the strip again. Taking the strip to be one unit in length, what are the lengths of the two new parts of the strip created by the crease?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.393,
            0.86,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": "",
