        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.519,
            0.884,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": "What will you get if you fold the previously-folded strip again into two equal parts? You will now get four equal parts."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.575,
